[ObservationEvent]
ObservationEvent (environment)
  Tool: finish
  Result: The bug in BedrockModel._format_request_message_content has been fixed by updating the code to use `next(iter(content), None)` instead of `next(iter(content))` when raising the TypeError. This prevents the bare StopIteration exception from being raised when content is an empty dictionary, ensuring the intended TypeError is raised instead. The fix matches the described minimal solution in the issue report. No further changes are necessary as this is a minimal and correct fix.
